• Design the complete concept in Figma 
• fully develop the most important homepage experience  
• demonstrate the remaining ideas through the prototype. 
The working website should maintain the same overall visual direction and design 
concept as your proposed design. We will consider both the implemented solution and your 
proposed design vision. 
Basic Administration / CMS 
A small administration area should be included to demonstrate your backend 
development, database design, and coding capabilities. 
The objective is not to build a complex CMS or administration system. A focused 
implementation that allows authorized users to log in and manage a limited amount of 
website content is sufficient. 
The system should consider at least two user roles: 
• Admin Role: can access and manage content across all brands. 
• Data Entry Role: can manage content only for the brand(s) assigned to them. 
The exact implementation, content to be managed, and overall administration structure 
are left to your technical judgment. But AGAIN, no need for complexity, just clean and well
structured code.   
We are primarily interested in seeing: 
• Clean code and project structure 
• Project structure and folder organization 
• Authentication 
• Role-based authorization and access control 
• CRUD functionality 
• Data validation 
• Security awareness 
• Separation of concerns 
• Database planning and ERD 
