• Sensible database structure 
• Maintainability 
Please keep this part simple and focused so that most of your assessment time can be 
spent on the public-facing experience. 
Assessment Guidelines 
1. Technology Stack 
The required backend technology stack for this assessment is PHP / Laravel. If you 
intend to use a different backend technology stack or framework, this must be requested in 
advance and approved by the Application & Development Team before proceeding with the 
assessment. 
2. Original Design or Redesign, Both Are Accepted 
You may approach the design in either of the following ways. 
Option 1: Original Concept: 
You may create your own fictional company, motorcycle brands, product information, visual 
identity and complete digital concept. 
Option 2: Redesign an Existing Website 
You may select an existing global website related to the same or a similar business field and 
propose your own redesign of it. This is completely acceptable for the purpose of this 
assessment. 
But, if you choose the redesign approach, you must clearly identify the original website 
and explain that your submission is a redesign concept. 
We still expect to see your own design thinking and improvements not simply 
reproducing the existing website. 
