Submission Requirements 
At the end of the assessment, please provide: 
• Source code repository 
• Instructions for setting up and running the project 
• Working/deployed website (URL), where possible 
• Figma design/prototype, if used 
• Admin/CMS test credentials, where applicable 
• Brief explanation of your technical approach and technology choices 
• Any assumptions made during the assessment 
• A short video demo presenting the implemented solution and its main features 
Note: After reviewing your submission, you may be requested to provide to have another 
online session to demonstrate your solution. 
 
 
Wish You All the Best !! 